# CurrencySync

Real-time currency converter with live exchange rates.

## Run it
Just open `index.html` in a browser (no build step needed).

## Files & Responsibilities
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `index.html` | Structure only |
| `css/style.css` | Styling only |
| `js/config.js` | Constants & settings |
| `js/api.js` | Fetching rates + caching |
| `js/converter.js` | Pure math (no DOM, no fetch) |
| `js/ui.js` | DOM reads/writes |
| `js/app.js` | Glue code / orchestration |

## API
Uses [open.er-api.com](https://www.exchangerate-api.com/) — free, no key required.
Rates cached for 5 minutes; auto-refresh every 60 seconds.